---
import CourseHome from '../../../../components/course/CourseHome.astro';
import { CELPIP } from '../../../../courses/celpip/syllabus';
import '../../../../styles/lesson-kit.css';
import '../../../../styles/english-kit.css';
---
<CourseHome course={CELPIP}>
  <section class="cs-builds">
    <h2>Learn it alone, step by step</h2>
    <p>This course is built so you never need a teacher. Go through it in order, one lesson at a time; each one ends with a quiz, and your progress is kept in this browser.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Know exactly what is coming.</strong> Every part of the test is explained with a map of the screen, the timing and the question types, so test day holds no surprises.</li>
      <li><strong>Listen for real.</strong> Listening practice is read aloud by your device's own voices, with a slower speed for learning, an exam mode that plays once like the real test, and a transcript that opens after you answer.</li>
      <li><strong>Practise under the clock.</strong> A writing pad with a 27-minute timer and a live word count, and a speaking timer with preparation and speaking time. You can record yourself and listen back; the recording never leaves your device.</li>
      <li><strong>See what a high level looks like.</strong> Model answers at different levels, with notes on why they score well, and checklists built on the four things raters look at.</li>
      <li><strong>Hundreds of original questions.</strong> Every lesson has a drill with instant marking and the reason for every answer, and a New questions button for another round.</li>
      <li><strong>Know your numbers.</strong> A calculator turns your levels into CLB and Express Entry language points, and a planner builds your week-by-week plan to test day.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="cs-small">fibub is not part of Paragon Testing Enterprises or CELPIP. Every question and recording script here is original. Preparing for a different test? See the free <a href="/learn/courses/toefl/">TOEFL preparation course</a>.</p>
  </section>
</CourseHome>
